        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the fundamentals of the Japanese language with <strong>Kana</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kana, you get to learn and practice <strong>Hiragana</strong> and <strong>Katakana</strong> which are two of the writing systems in Japanese. <br><br><strong>Note: </strong>The game teaches through English!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hiragana and Katakana Charts for Learning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/f4eb58474ad57fa57503ed9d9908b902.poster.avif?t=1760083816\" width=870 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/f4eb58474ad57fa57503ed9d9908b902.webm?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/f4eb58474ad57fa57503ed9d9908b902.mp4?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Writing Practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/774826e008e310089181f7cdeba567d1.poster.avif?t=1760083816\" width=870 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/774826e008e310089181f7cdeba567d1.webm?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/774826e008e310089181f7cdeba567d1.mp4?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to write each character with a stroke order visualizer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Typing Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/b24500690ceb931ed1274cce2b507c42.poster.avif?t=1760083816\" width=870 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/b24500690ceb931ed1274cce2b507c42.webm?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/b24500690ceb931ed1274cce2b507c42.mp4?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS</strong><br>Practice recognizing characters by typing out <strong>Romaji</strong> <i>(Japanese sounds represented by Roman alphabets)</i> to match the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive</strong><br>Match as much kana as you can to climb the leaderboard!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Color Palettes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/f4e20526e266eb4d5b027fc4ea104a3e.poster.avif?t=1760083816\" width=870 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/f4e20526e266eb4d5b027fc4ea104a3e.webm?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918720/extras/f4e20526e266eb4d5b027fc4ea104a3e.mp4?t=1760083816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of color palettes for users to customize the look of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
